<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank sets 3-month bill auction for Wed.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank sets 3-month bill auction for Wed.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Tuesday it would auction an unspecified tranche of its three-month liquidity bills on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The NBS gave no further details of the Dutch-style auction.</p>
<p>In its last successful auction of similar bills on August 28, the NBS set the yield at 9.3 percent after 9.3 percent on August 21.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
